Full Circle is a drama, horror, mystery film directed by Richard Loncraine.

3
00:15:28,421 --> 00:15:34,421
After the death of her daughter, wealthy housewife Julia Lofting abruptly leaves her
husband and moves into an old Victorian home in London to re-start her life.

4
